# Phase 5 remediation note (SENTINEL forensic audit, Docker safety):
# the api-gateway Dockerfile's build context is the repo root (see that
# file's own header for why), so this keeps caches, local envs, and
# anything env/secret-shaped out of the image, on top of only ever
# COPYing the specific subtrees it actually needs.

.git/
.github/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

dashboard/node_modules/
dashboard/.next/

*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

sync_files.py
